'''Waterfiends''' are demonic creatures of water{{CiteNPC|npc=Slayer Master|quote=Waterfiends are creatures of water, which live under the Baxtorian Lake. Their watery form is well defended against slashing and piercing weapons, so use something blunt. |loc=|notes=|name=}} found in the [[Ancient Cavern]] underneath the [[Baxtorian Falls]], as well as in [[Kraken Cove]] and [[Iorwerth Dungeon]]. They are moderately resistant to all forms of combat with the exception of crush and heavy ranged attacks, against which they are significantly more vulnerable. They use a magic attack whose projectile resembles [[Water Blast]], along with a [[magical ranged]] attack resembling [[ice arrows]].

[[Duradel]] and [[Konar quo Maten]] are the only [[Slayer Master|Slayer masters]] who assign waterfiends, and they are a rare assignment. To unlock waterfiends as a task, players must have at least level 75 [[combat]] (unless they have requested Slayer masters ignore combat level requirements), and have progressed [[Barbarian training]] up to being prompted to access to the [[Ancient Cavern]] as part of Barbarian Firemaking training.{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1290053229087043590|date=3 August 2020|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/104139|archivedate=3 August 2020|quote=Ah. It's the bit where you're being told about pyre ships, and Otto tells you to go jump in the whirlpool to get bones for them.}}

Killing a waterfiend may be a required step for an [[Clue scroll (elite) - Let's hope you don't meet a watery death when you encounter this fiend|elite clue scroll]].

